The 'components' folder contains reusable UI elements and interface modules that make up the game client's visual and interactive layers. These components are organized by function—such as modals, panes, and toolbars—and work together to provide a cohesive user experience across different views like chat, settings, equipment, and navigation. They integrate with the broader project by supporting core features like accessibility, plugins, graphics, and game automation while maintaining a consistent design and interaction model.
